{
  "title": "Taqeebaat e Namaz e Isha (2)",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "بِسْمِ اللهِ الرَّحْمٰنِ الرَّحِيْمِ\nBISMILLAAHIR RAHMAANIR RAHEEM\nIn the Name of Allah, the All-Merciful, the All-Compassionate.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ يَا سَبَبَ مَنْ لَا سَبَبَ لَهٗ\nALLAAHUMMA YAA SABABA MAN LAA SABABA LAHU\nO Allah, O Cause of him who has no cause,\nيَا سَبَبَ كُلِّ ذِيْ سَبَبٍ\nYAA SABABA KULLE ZEE SABABIN\nO Cause of everyone who has a cause,\nيَا مُسَبِّبَ الْاَسْبَابِ بِغَيْرِ سَبَبٍ\nYAA MUSABBEBAL ASBAABE BEGHAIRE SABABIN\nO Causer of causes without any cause,\nصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nSALLE ALAA MOHAMMADIN WA AALE MOHAMMAD\nsend blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad,\nوَ اَغْنِنِيْ بِحَلَالِكَ عَنْ حَرَامِكَ\nWA AGHNENEE BEHALAALEKA AN HARAAMEKA\nand enrich me with what You have made lawful, away from what You have made unlawful,\nوَ بِطَاعَتِكَ عَنْ مَعْصِيَتِكَ\nWA BETAA-ATEKA AN MASEYATEKA\nand with obedience to You, away from disobedience to You,\nوَ بِفَضْلِكَ عَمَّنْ سِوَاكَ\nWA BEFAZLEKA AMMAN SEWAAKA\nand with Your bounty, away from anyone other than You.\nيَا حَيُّ يَا قَيُّوْمُ يَا قَوِيُّ يَا غَنِيُّ يَا مَلِيُّ يَا وَفِيُّ\nYAA HAYYO YAA QAYYOOMO YAA QAWIYYO YAA GHANIYYO YAA MALIYYO YAA WAFIYYO\nO Living, O Self-Subsisting, O Strong, O Self-Sufficient, O Wealthy, O Faithful,\nبِرَحْمَتِكَ يَا اَرْحَمَ الرَّاحِمِيْنَ\nBERAHMATEKA YAA ARHAMAR RAAHIMEEN\nby Your mercy, O Most Merciful of the merciful."
}
